      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRETTY BOY FLOYD (4) hit the ground running off the cherry draw and never headed winning (24.41) at this track in Grade 5 over 440m. Is yet to taste defeat at this course. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Looks to have an edge on most of these. TAW MYSTIQUE (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (25.00) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a good record here including four wins. Can figure in the finish. CASH DE ORO (7) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and two minors from six tries. Hit the frame latest (20.16) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. BOHEMIAN LASS (8) jumps at a shorter journey and still warrants respect.",
